{"nodes": [{"id": "public_favicon_favicon_svg", "label": "Favicon del sitio (SVG 88x88)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "public_favicon_mark", "label": "Clase .mark (trazo unico del logotipo)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": "line 3, line 9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "public_favicon_dgo_wordmark", "label": "Logotipo DGO en pastilla redondeada", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": "line 9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Las tres letras D, G y O van encerradas en una pastilla de esquinas completamente redondeadas (radio 24 sobre una altura de 48, es decir un semicirculo en cada extremo). Las letras son contraformas: se recortan del solido en vez de dibujarse encima, de modo que un solo <path> con una sola regla de relleno resuelve toda la marca y no hay dos colores que mantener sincronizados."}, {"id": "public_favicon_prefers_color_scheme_dark", "label": "Relleno que responde al tema del sistema", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": "lines 2-7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "El icono no lleva fondo propio: el trazo se pinta casi negro (#101314) por defecto y casi blanco (#F2F4F3) cuando el sistema pide tema oscuro, mediante una regla @media incrustada en el propio SVG. Asi la marca se lee sobre la pestana clara y sobre la oscura sin necesitar dos archivos ni un fondo solido que recortaria la silueta de la pastilla. La consulta es prefers-color-scheme del sistema operativo, no el tema elegido en el sitio, porque un favicon se pinta fuera de la pagina y no ve el atributo del documento."}, {"id": "public_favicon_tinta_101314", "label": "Tinta clara #101314", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": "line 3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "public_favicon_tinta_f2f4f3", "label": "Tinta oscura #F2F4F3", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": "line 5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "public_favicon_viewbox_88", "label": "Lienzo 88x88 con traslacion vertical de 20", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": "line 1, line 8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "La marca mide 88x48 y se centra a lo alto dentro del cuadrado de 88 con translate(0 20), en lugar de recortar el viewBox a la forma real. Un favicon se pinta siempre en una caja cuadrada, y dejar el cuadrado explicito evita que el navegador estire la pastilla; la traslacion en el grupo deja intactas las coordenadas del path exportado."}], "edges": [{"source": "public_favicon_favicon_svg", "target": "public_favicon_mark", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": "line 9", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "public_favicon_mark", "target": "public_favicon_dgo_wordmark", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": "line 9", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "public_favicon_prefers_color_scheme_dark", "target": "public_favicon_mark", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": "lines 2-7", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "public_favicon_prefers_color_scheme_dark", "target": "public_favicon_tinta_101314", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": "line 3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "public_favicon_prefers_color_scheme_dark", "target": "public_favicon_tinta_f2f4f3", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": "line 5", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "public_favicon_viewbox_88", "target": "public_favicon_dgo_wordmark", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": "line 1, line 8", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "public_favicon_tinta_101314", "target": "public_favicon_tinta_f2f4f3", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": "lines 3-5", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "public_favicon_dgo_wordmark", "target": "public_favicon_favicon_svg", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "public/favicon.svg", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}